<title>EGYPT: ATHLETICS-EGYPTIANS WIN TOP PLACES IN EGYPTIAN MARATHON.</title>
<headline>ATHLETICS-EGYPTIANS WIN TOP PLACES IN EGYPTIAN MARATHON.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-02-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading results of  Friday's fourth International Egyptian Marathon run in the southern town of Luxor.</p>
<p>Men</p>
<p>1. Mohamed el-Moursy (Egypt) 2:29:36</p>
<p>2. Ashraf Sayed Biyoumi (Egypt) 2:29:59</p>
<p>3. Sabry Khalil Emara (Egypt) 2:30:57</p>
<p>Women</p>
<p>1. Anna Margrethe Trave (Norway) 3:00:34</p>
<p>2. Greta Koerber (Germany) 3:41:44</p>
<p>3. Irmard Eggert (Germany) 3:56:32</p>
</text>
